[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.31, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "哦。 哦，是的。 正在播出一部电视剧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4326.07, "timestamp": "01:12:06", "text": "。 你是从那里读到的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4327.99, "timestamp": "01:12:07", "text": "我看过这部电视剧。 我当时想："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4330.39, "timestamp": "01:12:10", "text": "“哦，这真不错。” 然后我就说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4333.03, "timestamp": "01:12:13", "text": "“好吧，我会看的，我会读的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4334.79, "timestamp": "01:12:14", "text": "虽然是中文动画。我很惊讶你居然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4336.47, "timestamp": "01:12:16", "text": "看了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.47, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "当然。我喜欢中文动画。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4341.35, "timestamp": "01:12:21", "text": "看过一个叫什么来着？《灵异妙探》。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4343.91, "timestamp": "01:12:23", "text": "我得看看第三季。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4345.51, "timestamp": "01:12:25", "text": "你还没看过？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4347.041, "timestamp": "01:12:27", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "is it manhwa or manhua (the chinese comic) ?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4347.91, "timestamp": "01:12:27", "text": "我还没看过。我只记得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4351.27, "timestamp": "01:12:31", "text": "第二季的两集。粉头发的女孩。还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4353.83, "timestamp": "01:12:33", "text": "之后的双胞胎。我还没看过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4354.79, "timestamp": "01:12:34", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4357.27, "timestamp": "01:12:37", "text": "我觉得她们在第三季里没出现。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.4, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4360.07, "timestamp": "01:12:40", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4361.99, "timestamp": "01:12:41", "text": "等等。她们会出现吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4363.51, "timestamp": "01:12:43", "text": "没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4370.63, "timestamp": "01:12:50", "text": "呃，是《魔女游戏》还是《魔女游戏》？天哪，是《魔女游戏》，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4374.229, "timestamp": "01:12:54", "text": "因为它现在是中文的了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4376.63, "timestamp": "01:12:56", "text": "我的意思是，《灵异妙探》只是动画。你不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4379.83, "timestamp": "01:12:59", "text": "知道原著。它只是动画。"}]